<color=#00ffff>Owner:</color> {Eden_WaterOwner}
<color=#00ffff>Lock Code:</color> {Eden_Password}
Here you can manage various upgrades and settings of your extractor.

Russian:
@q0 @d0<color=#00ffff>Экстракторы:</color> {Eden_UpgradeCount} / {Eden_Global_WaterMax}
<color=#00ffff>Владелец:</color> {Eden_WaterOwner}
